; asf-processes.process-map.udon — scenario-corpus edition
; Pseudo-real: same genre as asf/msc/meta-process-review-2026-07-07/
; PROCESS-MAP-v0.udon, rewritten in 0.9 idiom (references for the signal
; graph, flags, a node-valued attribute) with its own abridged content so
; the BDD scenarios can mutate it freely.

|process-map[asf-processes]
  :title The meta-processes of ASF, as a system
  :created <2026-07-07>
  :revised <2026-07-20>
  :version 0.2.0
  :status second-pass

  ; Conventions:
  ;   - Each process carries :health (from findings) and :drain.
  ;   - :drain is one of: healing | task-force | nil
  ;   - A `?` suffix marks a genuinely unknown sub-process we'd have to design.
  ;   - Signal flow is written as references (:feeds / :fed-by), one edge per
  ;     assignment, so the graph is navigable rather than prose.

  |meta-meta-process[self-governance]
    :name How this map governs and evolves itself
    :source-sink participant-feedback

    Kept to a few imperatives on purpose:
    - Make it easy to follow the *right current* process.
    - Make it just as easy to *evolve* a process.
    - Every participant may give feedback on *any* process.

  |cluster[spine]
    :name Decision-routing & stewardship
    :scope cross-cutting
    :steward
      |role :name coherence-steward :standing? :filled? false

    Every stall below reduces to a decision that never reached Joseph in
    actionable form; this is the parent, not a sibling.

    |process[decision-surfacing]
      :name Decision surfacing
      :health broken
      :drain healing
      :example spikes/epistemic-target-ontology/
      :feeds @process[valve]

      Recognize a genuine-Joseph fork, assemble a real brief, route it to a
      valve he can act from. The catch-rate is under half; the newer half
      leaks. Per-fork trigger + prune.

    |process[coherence-stewardship]?
      :name Coherence stewardship (the domain-master role)
      :health absent
      :drain nil
      :design-unknown how it's instantiated across turnover

      Not a gatekeeper; a check on cross-process coherence. A standing role,
      not a queue.

    |process[valve]
      :name The valve itself
      :health under-fed
      :drain healing
      :fed-by @process[decision-surfacing]
      :fed-by @process[finding-routing]

      The durable list of genuinely-his calls. Exists, well-designed,
      under-fed.

  |cluster[verification]
    :name Verification

    |process[de-novo-audits]
      :name De-novo audits (open-ended, multi-model, low-prescription)
      :health strong
      :drain healing
      :fed-by @process[spike-integration]
      :feeds @process[finding-routing]

      The crown-jewel method; each establishes **lower bounds** (found
      problems), never completeness. Strong method, no cadence or trigger.

    |process[follow-up-audits]?
      :name Follow-up / triggered audits
      :health absent
      :drain healing
      :design-unknown the trigger + the scoped-instruction generator

      Fired by an edit, especially multi-segment edits. **Does not exist** —
      a named gap.

    |process[empirical-verification]?
      :name Simulation / empirical verification
      :health absent
      :drain task-force
      :wire-to [vivarium relata papers]
      :design-unknown the whole empirical/sim discipline

      Sims, experiments, and benchmarks as first-class, with knowledge
      landing self-contained. No disciplined process yet; eleven `.py`
      files parked since March.

  |cluster[integration]
    :name Integration

    |process[finding-routing]
      :name Audit-finding routing (strengthen-first)
      :health healthy
      :drain healing
      :fed-by @process[de-novo-audits]
      :feeds @process[valve]

      Route, don't execute; disposition per finding.

    |process[audit-graduation]
      :name Audit graduation / working-dir clearing
      :health broken
      :drain task-force
      :backlog 22

      Verify dispositions + settle gold. Broken: 0 of 22 cleared; the
      gold-dir gate never convened.

    |process[spike-integration]
      :name Spike integration
      :health healthy
      :drain healing
      :feeds @process[de-novo-audits]

      Land the knowledge, route the artifact.

  |cluster[coherence]
    :name Coherence maintenance

    |process[lexicon]
      :name Naming / terminology / lexicon
      :health infra-healthy, decision-stalled
      :drain healing
      :feeds @process[valve]

      Infra healthy; ~506 currents unrouted; LEXICON reorg blocked.
      Route N per cycle + drain.

    |process[drift-repair]
      :name Cross-segment consistency / drift repair
      :health opportunistic
      :drain healing

      Idiom-drift, stale cross-refs.

  |diagram[core-loop]
    :caption The core loop
    !:text:
      generation --> verification --> integration --> [files change]
          ^                                                |
          +----------------- triggers <------- follow-up audit
                                                           |
                             THE SPINE (decision-routing) <+

  |diagnosis
    **The diagnosis in one sentence:** these are **un-clocked queues driven
    by a single human clock** — sources fire on Joseph's whim, so a burst of
    generation floods verification and integration, whose drains are also
    gated on Joseph; everything backs up between his sessions.

  |open-unknowns
    :items [follow-up-audits empirical-verification coherence-stewardship]

    The `?` items still to design: the follow-up-audit trigger, the
    empirical/sim discipline, and the coherence-steward role across
    turnover.
